Sat Nov 14 17:05:14 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Update to version 4.2.1
  * Bug Fixes
    + Fix ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException for surrogate pair in
      comment at buffer boundary
  * Documentation updates
    + Drop the Source Xref menu item
    + Stop pinning a version in the README snippet
  * Build
    + Draft the version the labels imply, not always a patch
  * Dependency updates
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 7.7.0 to 7.10.0
    + Bump mavenXmlVersion from 4.0.0-rc-6 to 4.0.0-rc-7
- Changes of 4.2.0
  * New features and improvements
    + Establish an automatic module name
    + Build the DOM with a local pull builder instead of Maven's
      deprecated XmlNodeBuilder
  * Documentation updates
    + Rewrite README with usage, status and version guidance
  * Maintenance
    + Set the next development version to 4.2.0-SNAPSHOT
    + Build against maven-xml 4.0.0-rc-6
    + Remove deprecated XmlNode references
  * Build
    + Update parent to plexus 27
  * Dependency updates
    + Depend on maven-api-xml at compile and maven-xml at runtime
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus from 25 to 26
    + Bump release-drafter/release-drafter from 6 to 7.7.0

